        "resizable": [
            true,
            true
        ]
    },
    maybe actually the children here should be a label containing the contact name and then buttons like,
    edit name,
    manage companies,
    manage addresses,
    manage phone numbers,
    etc,

    same for edit company but it would have manage people instead of manage companies. Might eventually be worth
    revisiting some of the design and logic surrounding the contact management module in general.
    "children": [
        {
            "name": "lbl_person_first_name",
